      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 64,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "But God will shoot at them. They will be suddenly struck down with an arrow.",
      "ko": "그러나 하나님이 저희를 쏘시리니 저희가 홀연히 살에 상하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "03ff3caaf59e62daed7fbbc2070707be88bfb54c8c4d7023c486b34c091d49f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "45c29b95340b007a65268e7c1d5b5db4909dc4f1f42ffaff95857373d2ca74cd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러나 하나님이 저희를 쏘시리니 저희가 홀연히 살에 상하리로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "45c29b95340b007a65268e7c1d5b5db4909dc4f1f42ffaff95857373d2ca74cd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:64:8",
      "sequence": 14859,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 64",
      "verse_label": "8",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
